This artifact bundles compiled parser code (.so / .a) generated from a
third-party tree-sitter grammar. The bundled parser code is derived
from tree-sitter (https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter, MIT) and
from the upstream grammar listed below. The original copyright notice
for each bundled grammar appears in its block; the MIT permission
notice that governs both this module and every bundled grammar is
reproduced once at the end of this file.
